<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>🔮 塔罗牌抽牌游戏</title>
<style>
    * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a0e27 0%, #1a1a4e 30%, #2d1b69 60%, #4a148c 100%);
        min-height: 100vh;
        color: #e8e6f0;
        overflow-x: hidden;
        position: relative;
    }

    /* 星星背景 */
    body::before {
        content: '';
        position: fixed;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        background-image: 
            radial-gradient(2px 2px at 20% 30%, #fff, transparent),
            radial-gradient(2px 2px at 40% 70%, #ffd700, transparent),
            radial-gradient(1px 1px at 60% 20%, #fff, transparent),
            radial-gradient(2px 2px at 80% 50%, #ff69b4, transparent),
            radial-gradient(1px 1px at 10% 80%, #fff, transparent),
            radial-gradient(2px 2px at 90% 90%, #ffd700, transparent),
            radial-gradient(1px 1px at 50% 10%, #fff, transparent),
            radial-gradient(1px 1px at 30% 60%, #ff69b4, transparent),
            radial-gradient(2px 2px at 70% 40%, #fff, transparent),
            radial-gradient(1px 1px at 85% 15%, #ffd700, transparent);
        background-size: 100% 100%;
        animation: twinkle 4s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: 0;
    }

    @keyframes twinkle {
        0% { opacity: 0.3; }
        100% { opacity: 0.8; }
    }

    .container {
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 40px 20px;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
    }

    /* 标题区域 */
    .header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 50px;
        animation: fadeInDown 1s ease-out;
    }

    .header h1 {
        font-size: 3rem;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
        background: linear-gradient(45deg, #ffd700, #ff69b4, #9370db);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        background-clip: text;
        text-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3);
        letter-spacing: 3px;
    }

    .header p {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        color: #b8b5d1;
        font-style: italic;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    @keyframes fadeInDown {
        from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-30px); }
        to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    /* 游戏区域 */
    .game-area {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 40px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.2);
        box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .slots-container {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 30px;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .card-slot {
        width: 140px;
        height: 200px;
        border: 2px dashed rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.4);
        border-radius: 15px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .card-slot:hover {
        border-color: #ffd700;
        box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3);
        transform: translateY(-5px);
    }

    .card-slot.selected {
        border-style: solid;
        border-color: #ffd700;
        box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.5);
        background: rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.1);
    }

    .card-slot.filled {
        border-style: solid;
        border-color: #9370db;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a4e, #2d1b69);
    }

    .slot-placeholder {
        font-size: 3rem;
        opacity: 0.3;
    }

    .slot-label {
        position: absolute;
        bottom: 10px;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: #9370db;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .card-display {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 10px;
    }

    .card-emoji {
        font-size: 3rem;
        margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .card-name {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: #ffd700;
        text-align: center;
        font-weight: bold;
    }

    .card-orientation {
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        color: #ff69b4;
        margin-top: 3px;
    }

    .buttons-container {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 20px;
        margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .btn {
        padding: 15px 40px;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        border: none;
        border-radius: 50px;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
        font-weight: bold;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    .btn-draw {
        background: linear-gradient(45deg, #ffd700, #ff8c00);
        color: #1a1a4e;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.4);
    }

    .btn-draw:hover {
        transform: translateY(-3px);
        box-shadow: 0 6px 25px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.6);
    }

    .btn-draw:disabled {
        opacity: 0.5;
        cursor: not-allowed;
        transform: none;
    }

    .btn-reset {
        background: linear-gradient(45deg, #9370db, #6a5acd);
        color: white;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(147, 112, 219, 0.4);
    }

    .btn-reset:hover {
        transform: translateY(-3px);
        box-shadow: 0 6px 25px rgba(147, 112, 219, 0.6);
    }

    /* 结果区域 */
    .result-area {
        margin-top: 30px;
        padding: 25px;
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        border-radius: 15px;
        border-left: 4px solid #ffd700;
        display: none;
        animation: slideIn 0.5s ease-out;
    }

    .result-area.show {
        display: block;
    }

    @keyframes slideIn {
        from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px); }
        to { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }
    }

    .result-title {
        color: #ffd700;
        font-size: 1.3rem;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .result-content {
        color: #d8d5e8;
        line-height: 1.8;
    }

    /* 牌库区域 */
    .deck-section {
        margin-top: 50px;
    }

    .deck-title {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        margin-bottom: 25px;
        color: #ffd700;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    .deck-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(100px, 1fr));
        gap: 15px;
    }

    .deck-card {
        aspect-ratio: 2/3;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a4e, #2d1b69);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3);
        border-radius: 10px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
        padding: 8px;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .deck-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-5px) scale(1.05);
        border-color: #ffd700;
        box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3);
    }

    .deck-card .emoji {
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .deck-card .name {
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: #ffd700;
        font-weight: bold;
    }

    /* 模态框 */
    .modal {
        display: none;
        position: fixed;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
        z-index: 100;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
    }

    .modal.show {
        display: flex;
    }

    .modal-content {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a4e, #2d1b69);
        border: 2px solid #ffd700;
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 40px;
        max-width: 500px;
        width: 90%;
        max-height: 80vh;
        overflow-y: auto;
        position: relative;
        animation: modalIn 0.3s ease-out;
        box-shadow: 0 0 50px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3);
    }

    @keyframes modalIn {
        from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.8); }
        to { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
    }

    .close-btn {
        position: absolute;
        top: 15px;
        right: 20px;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        cursor: pointer;
        color: #ffd700;
        transition: transform 0.3s;
    }

    .close-btn:hover {
        transform: rotate(90deg);
    }

    .modal-card-header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .modal-emoji {
        font-size: 4rem;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .modal-card-name {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        color: #ffd700;
        margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .modal-card-type {
        color: #9370db;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .modal-section {
        margin-top: 20px;
        padding-top: 20px;
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.2);
    }

    .modal-section h3 {
        color: #ffd700;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .modal-section p {
        color: #d8d5e8;
        line-height: 1.8;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    /* 响应式 */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .header h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
        .slots-container { gap: 15px; }
        .card-slot { width: 100px; height: 150px; }
        .btn { padding: 12px 25px; font-size: 0.95rem; }
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- 标题 -->
        <div class="header">
            <h1>🔮 塔罗牌抽牌游戏</h1>
            <p>✨ 凭你的直觉，选择一张属于你的塔罗牌 ✨</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 游戏区域 -->
        <div class="game-area">
            <div class="slots-container" id="slotsContainer">
                <div class="card-slot" data-slot="0" onclick="selectSlot(0)">
